  "content": "<h2>Dew Drop：每日天氣</h2>\n<p>允許整合包和伺服器開發者控制降雨的開始與結束時間。</p>\n<p>透過這個模組，您可以排定天氣在一天中的特定時段變化，例如讓早晨晴朗、傍晚下雨。您也可以允許隨機數（RNG）決定天氣狀況，同時掌控天氣持續的時間。</p>\n<p>預設情況下，每天的天氣事件（晴朗、下雨或暴風雨）將在每個 Minecraft 日的開始時決定，其中 60% 機率為晴朗天氣，20% 機率為下雨，10% 機率為暴風雨。天氣將整天保持一致，但在夜間有少量機率會發生變化。</p>\n<p>此模組是為 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fcollection%252f1jZQOrlw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dew Drop</a> 專案所設計，歡迎前往查看！</p>\n<h2>專案連結</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fcoolbot100s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/coolbot100s/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmmcreviews.com%252fowner%252fcoolbot100s%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/c7fd18efdadd1c3f12ae56b49afd834640d2d797/assets/cozy-minimal/available/mmcreviews_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modded Minecraft Reviews\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fcollection%252f146032%252fall-garden-gals-content%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s/Bouncy-Leaves/assets/76798835/0b2c0293-c2ab-4956-9055-70bc7d7141c5\" alt=\"Planet Minecraft\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/qxRVkGDjdJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s/Dew-Drop-Watering-Cans\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges